index 0000000..2b18c0b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7168.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed INTERNALERROR when an object defines a broken ``__getattribute__`` and a
+broken ``__repr__``, by retrieving the class name via ``type(obj)`` instead of
+``obj.__class__``.
